{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121303","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121303/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121303/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121303/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121303","id":4869021595,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7w1RiU","number":121303,"title":"Update `_show_error()` Method to include autowrap.","user":{"login":"unit-tick","id":267148939,"node_id":"U_kgDOD-xeiw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267148939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick","html_url":"https://github.com/unit-tick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":14,"created_at":"2026-07-12T22:28:44Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T07:15:12Z","closed_at":"2026-07-30T00:56:53Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121303","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121303","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121303.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121303.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"adds a bool `p_autowrap` so that longer error messages can be wrapped and not extend the length of the project manager window.\r\n\r\nThis is needed because I had already updated it in #119017 and find myself needing to update it again in my current work.\r\n\r\nExample:\r\nold behaviour\r\n<img width=\"558\" height=\"176\" alt=\"old_dialog\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e6461a88-48f6-43e9-90a1-fccc8d265376\" />\r\n\r\nnew behaviour\r\n<img width=\"327\" height=\"163\" alt=\"new_dialog\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a5b6883e-aa53-41df-9de0-d5aa53fe5772\" />\r\n\r\n### More Details\r\nSome more details as requested by ATS. The dialog can be made to wrap for singular errors:\r\n<img width=\"352\" height=\"187\" alt=\"error_autowrap\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/413962c9-ddaf-4613-9c01-79435df427b1\" />\r\n\r\nTaking up less horizontal space as opposed to it unwrapped counterpart: this is especially noticible with long directory paths.\r\n<img width=\"451\" height=\"189\" alt=\"error_nowrap\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0c5d6c26-675d-4fcc-8c16-400e91f9bb1f\" />\r\n\r\nHowever, the `minsize` can be increased when being utilised with compilation errors\r\n<img width=\"447\" height=\"192\" alt=\"error_compilation_nowrap\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4efe6f48-f778-4489-8141-85d0ed1c7a37\" />\r\n\r\nMaking it more readable than the wrapped counterpart\r\n<img width=\"362\" height=\"218\" alt=\"error_compilation_autowrap\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a28f0401-348f-495f-ae66-123ecbd1a068\" />\r\n\r\nIt's still autowrapped, allowing for more readability but still keeping the functionality intact for longer paths.\r\n<img width=\"469\" height=\"210\" alt=\"tolerance_reached\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bff9b910-2ab0-4db1-af47-a3bb83f2bdc2\" />\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"unit-tick","id":267148939,"node_id":"U_kgDOD-xeiw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267148939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick","html_url":"https://github.com/unit-tick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121303/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121303/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}